{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_061_diffusionmbir-title\">DiffusionMBIR</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">把预训练 2D diffusion slice prior 嵌入 3D MBIR/data-consistency 外循环，并显式加跨切片约束。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Embeds a pretrained 2D slice diffusion score prior into an alternating 3D Model-Based Iterative Reconstruction (MBIR) loop with explicit z-axis total variation regularization.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D 测量 y、体成像算子 A/A* 与预训练 2D diffusion prior</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D tomographic measurements y, 3D forward/adjoint operators A/A*, and a pretrained 2D axial diffusion model</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">数据一致且具跨切片约束的 3D 体 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Volumetric 3D reconstruction x̂ maintaining 3D measurement fidelity and inter-slice smoothness</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2023/html/Chung_Solving_3D_Inverse_Problems_Using_Pre-Trained_2D_Diffusion_Models_CVPR_2023_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DiffusionMBIR original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/c734a73bf00a8da07e76.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D 测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D y</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">稀疏/有限角 CT 投影或欠采样 MRI 数据</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d tomographic measurements y, 3d forward/adjoint operators a/a*, and a pretrained 2d axial diffusion model and prepares initial tensor representations (3D y).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"稀疏/有限角 CT 投影或欠采样 MRI 数据\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d tomographic measurements y, 3d forward/adjoint operators a/a*, and a pretrained 2d axial diffusion model and prepares initial tensor representations (3D y).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D 测量 y\" data-node-name-en=\"3D y\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">3D 测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D y</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">稀疏/有限角 CT 投影或欠采样 MRI 数据</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d tomographic measurements y, 3d forward/adjoint operators a/a*, and a pretrained 2d axial diffusion model and prepares initial tensor representations (3D y).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"真实 3D forward 与 adjoint，提供 volume-level 数据项\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes A / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"A / A*\" data-node-name-en=\"A / A*\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>A / A*</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">真实 3D forward 与 adjoint，提供 volume-level 数据项</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes A / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"沿预训练 2D prior 的 forward/noise schedule 定义尺度，并从 x_T/初始化反向更新\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs noise x_t within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"前向噪声状态 x_t\" data-node-name-en=\"noise x_t\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">前向噪声状态 x_t</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise x_t</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿预训练 2D prior 的 forward/noise schedule 定义尺度，并从 x_T/初始化反向更新</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs noise x_t within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把体按一个或多个正交方向拆成 2D slices\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2D slice within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"2D 切片视图\" data-node-name-en=\"2D slice\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">2D 切片视图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D slice</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把体按一个或多个正交方向拆成 2D slices</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2D slice within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练 2D score/denoiser 在每个噪声尺度处理切片\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2D diffusion prior within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"2D diffusion prior\" data-node-name-en=\"2D diffusion prior\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>2D diffusion prior</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练 2D score/denoiser 在每个噪声尺度处理切片</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2D diffusion prior within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把切片 prior 更新重新堆叠到共享体坐标\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"重组 3D 体\" data-node-name-en=\"3D\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">重组 3D 体</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把切片 prior 更新重新堆叠到共享体坐标</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3D 正则/一致性项抑制独立切片造成的不连续\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs slice constraint within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"跨切片约束\" data-node-name-en=\"slice constraint\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">跨切片约束</span><span class=\"lang-en\">slice constraint</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3D 正则/一致性项抑制独立切片造成的不连续</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs slice constraint within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"利用 A*(A x-y) 与 3D regularizer 更新体状态\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs MBIR / DC within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"MBIR / DC\" data-node-name-en=\"MBIR / DC\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>MBIR / DC</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">利用 A*(A x-y) 与 3D regularizer 更新体状态</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs MBIR / DC within the core slice diffusion 3d mbir computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"各 t 交替 2D prior、3D regularization 与 measurement update；原方法走离散 reverse updates，不是 PF-ODE\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies reverse diffusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"逆扩散外循环\" data-node-name-en=\"reverse diffusion\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">逆扩散外循环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">reverse diffusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">各 t 交替 2D prior、3D regularization 与 measurement update；原方法走离散 reverse updates，不是 PF-ODE</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies reverse diffusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"t=0 的 3D 重建\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces volumetric 3d reconstruction x̂ maintaining 3d measurement fidelity and inter-slice smoothness via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_061_diffusionmbir', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">t=0 的 3D 重建</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces volumetric 3d reconstruction x̂ maintaining 3d measurement fidelity and inter-slice smoothness via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DiffusionMBIR Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 2D diffusion 先验约束下的 3D MBIR 数据一致性</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Alternating 2D Slice Diffusion Prior Updates &amp; 3D ADMM/CG Measurement Data Consistency with z-TV</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DiffusionMBIR：核心公式 · 2D diffusion 先验约束下的 3D MBIR 数据一致性\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"61\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"24.636172pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -68.996029 340.207976 24.636172\" width=\"340.207976pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M1.854863-.797012L1.74618-.84773C1.35492-.39126 1.231745-.275331 1.101325-.275331C.992642-.275331 .934677-.362278 .978151-.45647L1.651988-2.85475H2.347561L2.383789-3.101099H1.717198L1.905582-3.847392L1.833127-3.956075H1.81139C1.782408-3.956075 1.74618-3.934339 1.717198-3.890865C1.412884-3.528587 .91294-3.137327 .6521-3.079363C.45647-3.021398 .39126-2.977925 .39126-2.898224C.39126-2.898224 .39126-2.876487 .405751-2.85475H1.021624L.427488-.724556C.347787-.485452 .304313-.246349 .304313-.173893C.311559-.021737 .478207 .094192 .702819 .094192C1.079588 .094192 1.347674-.108683 1.854863-.797012Z\" id=\"m061_g10-67