114\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"182.770514\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g10-71\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"187.522432\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g7-68\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"199.455381\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g1-61\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"208.688459\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g13-102\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"216.112624\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g4-0\" y=\"-59.656309\"></use><use x=\"221.028979\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g17-50\" y=\"-59.656309\"></use><use x=\"215.25534\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g10-72\" y=\"-53.080991\"></use><use x=\"225.910665\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g13-22\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"232.12734\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g4-3\" y=\"-59.656309\"></use><use x=\"236.549054\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g7-185\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"241.012311\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g13-22\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"247.228987\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g13-71\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"254.349435\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g7-0\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"263.298042\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g13-72\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"268.100033\" xlink:href=\"#m061_g7-186\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">训练真正 3D diffusion 的数据与显存成本很高</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Training native whole-volume high-resolution 3D diffusion models is bottlenecked by scarce 3D cohorts and extreme GPU memory.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以预训练 2D diffusion prior 配合 3D measurement fidelity/MBIR</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Apply a data-efficient pretrained 2D axial score prior slice-by-slice while enforcing 3D physical data consistency and z-axis TV continuity in an outer splitting loop.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">跨切片/体积一致性正则把 2D prior 复用于 3D inverse tasks</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pragmatically bridges 2D generative score priors to 3D cone-beam/helical CT and 3D MRI reconstruction without 3D diffusion training.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于 sparse/limited-angle CT 与 compressed-sensing MRI</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Used for sparse-view CT, limited-angle CT, and volumetric compressed-sensing reconstruction.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">有代表性的 3D 折中；2D slice prior 不等于真实 3D anatomy</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Practical 2D-to-3D reconstruction compromise; slice-wise 2D priors plus z-TV still cannot fully capture complex 3D non-local anatomical priors.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">复用数据充足、成本较低的 2D diffusion prior，避免从头训练完整 3D 生成模型。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">3D A/A* 数据项把所有切片共同约束到同一测量，跨切片正则补偿独立 2D prior。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">每个逆时间步交替 prior 与 MBIR/DC，形成 physics-guided sampling，而非纯切片生成。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Apply a data-efficient pretrained 2D axial score prior slice-by-slice while enforcing 3D physical data consistency and z-axis TV continuity in an outer splitting loop.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Pragmatically bridges 2D generative score priors to 3D cone-beam/helical CT and 3D MRI reconstruction without 3D diffusion training.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Alternating 2D Slice Diffusion Prior Updates &amp; 3D ADMM/CG Measurement Data Consistency with z-TV.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合稀疏/有限角 CT 和压缩感知 MRI 等 3D inverse problems 的低成本 prior 复用。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">2D prior 仍可能产生切片间不一致或把罕见三维结构投射为常见二维形态，必须做体级和测量域验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Used for sparse-view CT, limited-angle CT, and volumetric compressed-sensing reconstruction.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Practical 2D-to-3D reconstruction compromise; slice-wise 2D priors plus z-TV still cannot fully capture complex 3D non-local anatomical priors.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2023/papers/Chung_Solving_3D_Inverse_Problems_Using_Pre-Trained_2D_Diffusion_Models_CVPR_2023_paper.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Solving 3D Inverse Problems using Pre-trained 2D Diffusion Models</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/hyungjin-chung/DiffusionMBIR\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}